      "meta_description": "Big Sur, Ca\n\t\n\tI was trying to take this same photo a few minutes earlier with a middle aged man standing by the phone.  He was standing in front of the dial pad, which was ruining the composition, so i asked him if he could move over a step while i took the picture.  \"Wait your fucking turn pal!\" As i walked away I heard \"Of course I won't be late mom! I wouldn't miss your Cherry Pie!\" \n\tSo i went back to sitting on the hood of my jeep waiting for someone else to walk up to the phone so i could take the photo.  The man walked past after he finished his phone call and muttered \"all this for a picture of a fucking cat\"\n\t\n\tThe End."
